To mandel n as whole number.
    If n is at most 0.
        Give back 1 as whole number.
    Otherwise if n is at most 1.
        Give back 2 as whole number.
    Changeable n1 is n minus 1.
    Changeable n2 is n minus 2.
    Changeable v1 is mandel n1.
    Changeable v2 is mandel n2.
    Changeable s1 is v2 plus v2.
    Changeable s2 is v1 plus s1.
    Changeable s3 is s2 plus n.
    Give back s3 as whole number.
Say mandel 40.
